    { "id": "shots-intro", "x": 0, "y": -170, "w": 520, "page": "page-1", "text": "Hi-fi screens for the local web console (top row) and the CLI (bottom row). Same engine, same event stream: the run view and the terminal show the identical step tree.\nData is a sample 8.2.0 PRO server; hotfix ids and paths are examples." },
